OL,3,GNEWSAMorecambe Bay tops NHS list for
OL,4,Apatient data access breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital trust has said it has "zero
OL,7,Ftolerance" for staff snooping on
OL,8,Fpatients' data after figures showed it
OL,9,Fhad the highest number of incidents of
OL,10,Fit in the country.
OL,12,FThe University Hospitals of Morecambe
OL,13,FBay NHS Foundation Trust had 242
OL,14,Fincidents between 2021 and 2026, the
OL,15,FPress Association's Freedom of
OL,16,FInformation (FOI) requests showed.
OL,18,FThe trust has not yet revealed what
OL,19,Faction it has taken over the incidents.
